WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.050
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.050
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:32.280
You think this is going to be easy?

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:34.490
Then I'll attack you!

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:37.910
Please!

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:40.490
Please let me win!

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:43.040
Let you win?

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:44.660
Now's my chance.

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:46.460
You left yourself open!

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:51.380
Chris made Danny lower his guard and tackled him!

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:52.710
Chris pins Danny!

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.210
That's cheating, Chris!

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:56.220
You're such a softy, Danny!

00:01:56.220 --> 00:02:01.100
Christopher Thorndyke makes it to the second round by outsmarting him!

00:02:01.990 --> 00:02:07.000
Episode 46

00:02:01.990 --> 00:02:07.000
Sonic Battle - Finale!!

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:11.020
Stop! Stay back!

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:19.380
Quarter Finals

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:19.380
1st Match
Knuckles VS Chris

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:23.080
I told you to stop!

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:25.490
What's happening?

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:27.120
Tails, what are your thoughts?

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:31.290
Knuckles never fights anyone who's weaker than him.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:34.250
I told you to stay back!

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.770
Does Chris know this?

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.270
By looking at his fighting style, he probably does.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.520
Sorry, but I'm going to win!

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:54.940
Are you sure you want to win?

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:57.230
If you win, your next opponent will be...

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:03.740
Rouge or Amy.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:08.500
Rouge will fight hard because she wants the Chaos Emerald.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:11.370
And who knows what Amy will do.

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:12.880
What I should do is...

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.670
My stomach suddenly hurts! I give up!

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:20.170
Knuckles the Echidna!

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:22.470
Sometimes you win by losing.

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:23.550
Yeah.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.890
You did a great job making it this far, Chris.

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:38.030
Mr. Stewart, do you think you'll win?

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:41.450
Huh? Aren't you Director Fr-

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:43.200
No, you're mistaken!

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.740
Excuse me!

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:48.930
2nd Match 
 E-77    wins by default

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:52.940
3rd Match
 Emerl VS Tanaka

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:56.960
Feel my Shitten Batto Sword Style!

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:13.020
What?

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:19.280
It mastered my Shiten Batto Style!

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.070
I give up.

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:26.570
It did it!

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:32.350
4th Match
 Rouge VS Amy

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.170
Here I come!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.420
I hope you entertain me!

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.550
I'm glad I surrendered.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:01.230
Do you still want to continue?

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:09.910
The semifinals will be Emerl vs E-77 and Knuckles vs Rouge.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.960
They're overdoing it!

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:19.080
And they're persistent!

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:24.760
Stop, Eggman!

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:28.680
No one is stupid enough to stop just because someone tells them to!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:35.810
The surprising first match of the semifinals is a battle between robots.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:34.450
Semi Finals

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:34.450
1st Match
 E-77 VS Emerl

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:52.280
E-77 became tired and fell on its own!

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:55.200
Emerl is the winner!

00:05:56.040 --> 00:06:00.250
Wow! Emerl made the finals!

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:04.940
2nd Match
 Rouge VS Knuckles

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:14.640
How troubling.

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:17.980
That echidna isn't going to show me any mercy.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:20.480
I only have a fifty-fifty chance of winning.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:23.770
But I really want that Chaos Emerald.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:25.610
I know!

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:30.990
Knuckles, since you're fighting against a lady, will you give me a handicap?

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.080
What kind?

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.410
It's nothing big.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:47.760
It's so dark that I can't see a thing!

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:50.050
Where are you, bat girl?

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.470
Over here!

00:06:56.220 --> 00:07:02.230
We have no idea what's going on inside, but it sounds like they're having a furious fight.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:03.770
Tails, what are your thoughts?

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:09.110
Rouge has the advantage in the dark because she can locate her opponent using ultrasound. However...

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:13.490
Here comes the final blow!

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.880
I never let my prey escape.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:29.670
Rouge advances to the finals!

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:35.260
Wait!

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:41.850
My fist is invincible!

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:44.900
It's Knuckles! Knuckles wins!

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:53.110
You're so stubborn!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:58.580
I'm currently busy preparing a humongous project, so I don't have time to waste on you!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.660
You're the one who's stubborn!

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:03.250
"Humongous project?" Whatever!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:06.040
Your plans haven't even succeeded once yet!

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:10.460
Oh my! You're saying that it's my fault?

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:13.260
It's because you always interfere!

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:16.180
Yes! And I'm going to interfere again!

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:19.930
What an uncooperative hedgehog!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.310
Prepare yourself!

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:25.900
It's showtime!

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.360
Farewell!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.950
That's all for today!

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:37.830
You'll pay for this!

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:43.290
We will now begin the championship match of the Chaos Emerald martial arts tournament!

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:47.080
In the red corner, Knuckles the Echidna!

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:50.880
In the blue corner, Emerl!

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:54.130
Fight fair and square!

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:56.430
The championship match is about to begin!

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.800
They both charge from their corners!

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.890
Here I go!

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:12.530
How's this?

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:15.360
Emerl, hang in there!

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:20.370
What?

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:22.620
It's Sonic's Spin Attack!

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:44.560
Emerl is beating up Knuckles.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:48.810
He used up all his stamina in our match.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:55.030
I can't keep watching Knuckles suffer!

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:00.160
Ring the bell! The referee stops the match!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:04.910
Emerl is the winner!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:09.420
Is it because I threw in the towel?

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:12.380
It's a mistake! I was just trying to stop Emerl!

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:16.170
I'm sorry, Knuckles!

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:18.010
What are you talking about?

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:25.470
So it wasn't because I threw in the towel!

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:31.360
You're pretty good.

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:34.530
Let's battle again when I'm in better condition.

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:38.700
There's no way he could've won after battling so hard against me.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:05.100
It's time for the awards ceremony.

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:09.560
Emerl, it's the awards ceremony.

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:12.770
Since you won, you should go with your head held high.

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:16.900
Everyone, give it a round of applause!

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:23.370
Emerl, congratulations on your victory.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:25.700
Now then...

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:35.460
For winning the tournament, Emerl will receive the Chaos Emerald as the grand prize.

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:41.630
Emerl, we're counting on you to take part in the anti-Eggman project.

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:44.600
Here you go.

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:50.230
Because of you, I also faced danger!

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:51.520
I'm sorry.

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:54.560
We're sorry that we caused you such inconvenience.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:56.980
Push.

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:03.860
Everyone, give Emerl another round of applause!

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:46.490
Emerl? What's wrong, Emerl?

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:49.160
You don't have to fight anymore!

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:20.110
Stop, Emerl!

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:25.450
Watch out!

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:34.710
Why are you doing this, Emerl?

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:36.120
Why?

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:41.300
I won't forgive you for attacking Cream's mother, Emerl!

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:54.060
Take that!

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.640
Help me, Sonic!

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:59.310
I'll face you!

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:01.770
Emerl, stop!

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:03.190
What's wrong with you?

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:05.650
Why are you doing this all of a sudden?

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:12.080
Cream!

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:14.750
Are you okay, Cream?

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.120
Yes.

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:39.770
Emerl, why?

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:48.280
There must've been some kind of reaction between Emerl's AI chip and the Chaos Emerald.

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:52.070
What's going to happen? Can Emerl revert back to its old self?

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.280
I don't know.

00:14:56.700 --> 00:15:00.670
Oh my! It's totally destroying the city!

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.630
The town is a complete mess.

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.710
That's its true identity.

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:10.300
It's an ancient combat robot that can acquire its opponents' abilities.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:15.390
By giving it tremendous energy from the Chaos Emerald, it's only natural that this would happen.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:30.450
You picked a fight with us.

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:34.370
So you know what's going to happen!

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:46.590
Emerl's copy ability is incredible.

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:53.970
No matter how strong the opponent, since it fights by copying the opponent's ability, their strengths are equal.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:56.510
The opponent can't do anything.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:16:00.020
The opponent is losing due to his own abilities.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:02.310
He's helpless.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.810
He truly is helpless.

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.610
I don't need your help!

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.530
I can beat it on my own!

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:12.070
You're in my way, so can you please move?

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:13.740
Shut up! I'm not done!

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:15.450
I'll help too!

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:21.040
Amy!

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:22.870
Sonic, you saved me again!

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:26.000
Sonic!

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.340
Why?

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:30.260
Why is Emerl doing this?

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:36.720
Damn! What can I do?

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:38.350
I'll fight too!

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:40.310
Tails, let's do it!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:44.480
Sorry...

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.150
Me too...

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:00.540
This fight doesn't end.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:02.620
It's like I'm fighting against myself.

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:05.500
But we have to keep fighting!

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:09.420
We have to stop it somehow!

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:10.250
Okay!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:11.170
Yeah!

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:12.760
Sonic...

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:18.220
If it copies and attacks you with your own ability, there's nothing you can do.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:20.390
That means it'll continue to be a one-sided attack.

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:22.850
Can't anyone stop Emerl?

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.730
Up ahead is...

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.530
I'm done. I need to rest.

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:39.160
Gosh!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:51.210
What can we do? Sonic is at a disadvantage if he has to fight at the ocean!

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.090
Watch out, Sonic!

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:58.340
Cheese!

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:03.930
Cream!

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:06.480
Are you all right, Sonic?

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:09.650
Knuckles!

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:14.780
Emerl!

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:19.860
What's the matter with you?

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:28.710
Anyone who does horrible things to my friends is no friend of mine!

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:32.170
Emerl?

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:39.130
Cream!

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:52.150
Are you okay, Cream?

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:56.320
Knuckles's punch is pretty powerful.

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:21.890
Wow.

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:23.930
Why isn't it copying her attack?

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:26.310
Maybe it likes young girls.

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:27.810
There's no way that's true.

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:43.870
I get it! It can only copy a single person's abilities!

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:46.330
It can't copy combo attacks!

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.700
That's good to hear.

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:48.620
Hey, Rouge!

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:51.710
I know. It's time for payback!

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:53.120
You can't.

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:54.170
Why not?

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:56.920
We have one or two combo attacks!

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:58.800
That's not what I mean.

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:01.260
The ones who will defeat Emerl are...

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:05.010
Cheese! Here we go!

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:13.690
Emerl...

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:15.610
Emerl...

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:25.450
I feel sorry for it.

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:28.160
But it'll be fine because we're friends.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.000
Chris!

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:41.050
Emerl?

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:46.300
Thank you, Emerl!

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:49.060
Emerl, this is for you.

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:51.810
Here you go.

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:55.100
Let's make more together.

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:58.690
Emerl!

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:24.760
Emerl!

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:55.960
Cheese, don't cry.

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:59.710
There was no other choice.

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:35.620
Emerl!

00:22:56.770 --> 00:23:00.580
<b>Ikuse! Ikina furumaide nomiso <i>engine</i>  furukaiten</b>

00:22:56.770 --> 00:23:00.580
<i>Let's go with a positive attitude. Brain engine full rotation</i>

00:23:00.580 --> 00:23:02.440
<b>Shiteyattemiyoze eronnakoto</b>

00:23:00.580 --> 00:23:02.440
<i>Let's try various things</i>

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:04.800
<b>ni zen nokakete i donnakoto</b>

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:04.800
<i>Tackle them with everything we got</i>

00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:06.550
<b>Chance baitori <i>Jump like Sonic</i></b>

00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:06.550
<i>Double the chance. Jump like Sonic!</i>

00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:08.720
<b>Shogaiwa hitotsuno janrunai <i>topic</i></b>

00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:08.720
<i>Life is a topic with more than one genre</i>

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:10.160
<b>Bikkutoshine de <i>big dream</i></b>

